Project Design Phase Phase
# ComicCraft — Project Design Phase

 The **Project Design Phase** turns the ComicCraft idea into a concrete product and technical blueprint. The focus here is on **architecture, screens, data flow, AI design, database structure, and component organization**—before implementation begins.

 ## 1\. Project Definition

 **Project:** ComicCraft\
 **Type:** AI-powered web application\
 **Purpose:** Transform a user's story idea into an editable comic using Gemini models.

 ### Core flow

```
User Idea
   ↓
Comic Creation Wizard
   ↓
Gemini Story Engine
   ↓
Story + Characters + Pages + Panels
   ↓
Comic Editor
   ↓
AI Refinement
   ↓
Preview
   ↓
Export / Save
```

---

 # 2\. System Architecture

 A practical architecture for ComicCraft:

```
                    ┌──────────────────────┐
                    │      ComicCraft      │
                    │     Web Browser      │
                    └──────────┬───────────┘
                               │
                         HTTPS / API
                               │
              ┌────────────────▼────────────────┐
              │       Next.js Application       │
              │                                 │
              │  UI / Pages / Components        │
              │  Authentication                 │
              │  API Routes                     │
              │  Validation                     │
              └───────────────┬─────────────────┘
                              │
             ┌────────────────┼─────────────────┐
             │                │                 │
             ▼                ▼                 ▼
      ┌────────────┐   ┌─────────────┐   ┌─────────────┐
      │   Gemini   │   │  Database   │   │   Storage   │
      │   Models   │   │             │   │             │
      └────────────┘   └─────────────┘   └─────────────┘
