 # 3\. Recommended Technology Stack

 | Layer | Technology |
| --- | --- |
| Frontend | Next.js + React |
| Language | TypeScript |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS |
| UI components | shadcn/ui or custom components |
| AI | Gemini API |
| AI SDK | Google GenAI SDK |
| API | Next.js Route Handlers |
| Validation | Zod |
| Database | PostgreSQL |
| ORM | Prisma |
| Authentication | Auth.js or equivalent |
| File storage | Cloud object storage |
| Deployment | Vercel or equivalent |
| Export | PDF/image generation library |

The important architectural principle is that **Gemini should be behind server-side API routes**, rather than being called directly from React components.

