 # 12\. Structured AI Output

 ComicCraft should use structured data rather than relying on free-form AI text.

 Example:

```
{
  "title": "The Robot Beneath Room 17",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi Adventure",
  "tone": "Funny and mysterious",
  "characters": [
    {
      "id": "char_01",
      "name": "Arjun",
      "age": 16,
      "description": "Curious high-school student",
      "personality": ["brave", "sarcastic"]
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "panels": [
        {
          "panelNumber": 1,
          "sceneDescription": "A busy school hallway",
          "caption": "Monday morning...",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "characterId": "char_01",
              "text": "I'm definitely going to be late."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

 This allows React to render the comic deterministically.

