 # 13\. Story Bible Design

 A **Story Bible** should be created for every comic.

```
Story Bible
│
├── World
├── Timeline
├── Characters
├── Locations
├── Important Objects
├── Story Rules
├── Tone
└── Visual Style
```

 This becomes persistent context for future AI operations.

 It is particularly useful for:

 > **Continue Story**

 because Gemini can reference existing characters and events instead of inventing unrelated ones.

